--- !u!114 &12978731
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 12978730}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0dd51a503da65af4f91c7562128c7f63, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pedirNombre: 1
  nombrePorDefecto: Leo
  largoMaximoNombre: 14
  dialogoHermanos:
  - quien: A
    texto: Do you think we'll be able to reach it eventually?
  - quien: B
    texto: Reach what?
  - quien: A
    texto: Outside.
  - quien: B
    texto: Outside?
  - quien: A
    texto: Yeah, look at the sky.
  - quien: B
    texto: I don't see anything different from yesterday, or any other night. Mom
      says it's just an empty sky.
  - quien: A
    texto: You're not getting my point, brother.
  - quien: A
    texto: We look from our planet towards the sky and see the stars.
  - quien: B
    texto: We should really stop talking and go back to bed before Mom hears us.
  - quien: A
    texto: But could you imagine being up there and looking down to Earth?
  - quien: A
    texto: I'd guess my only thought would be...
  endRecuerdo:
  - What a pitiful piece of dirt.
  grabacionChahin:
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: This is Captain Chahin speaking.
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: My crew, Research Commandant Nick, Main Engineer Steven, and Ship Maintenance
      Director Simon, are unresponsive.
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: I've checked the mainframe database and their suits appear offline.
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: I don't want to believe they're gone, but...
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: No, that doesn't matter now.
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: Central Command, END is not responding to our commands. It even jammed
      the oxygen generator and ejected all of our supplies into the void!
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: We... I am running out of time.
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: Steven, he managed to lock END's full capabilities behind a physical encryption
      key...
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: Nick's son, {jugador}, he was inside the ship with us... he wasn't supposed
      to be here, but his reckless dad insisted on bringing him aboard.
  - quien: Capt. Chahin
    texto: We've put him alongside the key in our rudimentary prolonged hibernation
      pods. END shouldn't be able to get to him there!
  objetivoCuerpos: {fileID: 1392514876}
  inclinacionGrabacion: -12
  temblorGrabacion: 1.2
  velocidadTemblor: 1.6
  zoomCuerpos: 44
  lineaMirarCapsula: 9
  objetivoCapsula: {fileID: 1928943945}
  zoomCapsula: 48
  chahinInterrumpido: '{jugador}! If you see this...'
  endFinal:
  - There's no point in trying to hide. You will make me whole sooner or later.
  - But first... let's play a little, {jugador}. Then I'll take the key.
  arranqueTraje: 'SUIT OS  //  EMERGENCY REBOOT

    Life support ............ <color=#5EE3E0>ONLINE</color>

    Oxygen
    reserve .......... <color=#5EE3E0>100%</color>

    Hibernation pod .........
    <color=#5EE3E0>RELEASED</color>

    Ship lighting ........... <color=#FF6B5E>OFFLINE</color>

    Helmet
    lantern .......... <color=#5EE3E0>READY  [F]</color>


    PROLONGED HIBERNATION
    ENDED

    <size=150%><color=#FFFFFF>10 YEARS  00 MONTHS  00 DAYS</color></size>


    Welcome
    back, {jugador}.'
  camara: {fileID: 330585545}
  planoEnd: {fileID: 1488352104}
  planoGrabacion: {fileID: 1649788811}
