  lineasEnd:
  - So that's where he's headed, huh... Then I'd better not disappoint them.
  - Keep watching, brother.
  musicaFinal: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc049c8f3bab5534b9bd0750033ecfcc, type: 3}
  volumenMusica: 0.55
  musicaNivel: {fileID: 1022127865}
  segTension: 30
  segDespegue: 50
  segEnd: 55
  segCreditos: 70
  creditos: {fileID: 1885365992}
  textoGracias: {fileID: 2086917896}
  textoNombres: {fileID: 1835206729}
  gracias: Thanks for playing
  nombres: Juan Nieto  //  Keyner Moises  //  Juan Castillo
  quienLlama: Colony  //  Survivor
  lineas:
  - '{jugador}? Can you hear me? This is the colony. We picked up your suit''s signal.'
  - Listen carefully. END took control of the main ship orbiting Saturn.
  - It used the technology of the nearby ships and satellites to build platforms
    like the one you just crossed.
  - That pod doesn't have enough power to reach Saturn. You'll have to stop at other
    platforms along the way.
  - END most likely knows that... expect more obstacles to get through.
  - The colony survivors are fine, for now. We don't know for how long.
  - We need the encryption key you're carrying to shut END down. Good luck.
